  "prefLabel": "Lot 7002.16 Game program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.16 “Game program” means a written document available to all players prior to the start of any bingo event that describes the name(s), type(s), and order of the game(s) to be played, all prizes to be offered, and such other information as specified in Lot 7005.07.\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34 (formerly Lot 7002.13)",
